# The repository is checked out and verified on Windows as well as Linux, and
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"`. Without this, Git's Windows
# default (`core.autocrlf=true`) rewrites every text file to CRLF on checkout
# and `pnpm format:check` fails on the whole tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
